 ting with a quick warmup + 10-20min set of sprints + 3K easy-pace recovery 
 run + 10-20min set of sprints + cool-down stretches.Sprints sets: this will
  be a set of exercises in pairs or teams of 3 (depending on the numbers). O
 ne person will be sprinting towards some markers (trees/lamp posts) and bac
 k while their pals will be doing some exercises for active recovery before 
 swapping over.Sounds intense? Don’t panic! Do it at your own pace. This s
 ession will be adapted to everyone’s abilities and adapted exercises will
  be offered when needed.Meeting point: Priory Park (by the Splash)Meeting t
